d 2x" data-file-width="339" data-file-height="154" data-file-type="bitmap" height="114" width="250" class="mw-file-element mw-file-upright" style="--mw-file-upright: 1"/></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Type</th><td class="infobox-data category"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Public_company" title="Public company">Public</a> (Public Establishment)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Industry</th><td class="infobox-data category"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Construction_industry" title="Construction industry" class="mw-redirect">Construction</a></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Founded</th><td class="infobox-data">11<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>August 1987<span class="noprint"><span typeof="mw:Entity">;</span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>39 years ago</span><span style="display:none"><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>(<span class="bday dtstart published updated">1987-08-11</span>)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Headquarters</th><td class="infobox-data label">J9CV+3GX, <div class="ib-company-locality locality"> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Es_Sénia" title="Es Sénia">Es Sénia</a></div>, <div class="ib-company-country country-name"> Algeria</div><span style="display:none" data-plural="1"></span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label"><div style="display: inline-block; line-height: 1.2em; padding: .1em 0; ">Area served</div></th><td class="infobox-data">Worldwide</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Key<span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>people</th><td class="infobox-data agent">Abdelkader Kessal <span style="font-size: 85%;">(Chairman)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Services</th><td class="infobox-data category">Infrastructure and property construction, transport infrastructure <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Concession_(contract)" title="Concession (contract)">concessions</a> (airports)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row" class="infobox-label">Website</th><td class="infobox-data"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://lesaeroportsdoran.dz/" class="external text">lesaeroportsdoran.dz</a></td></tr></tbody></table>

<p id="mwBQ"><b id="mwBg">EGSA Oran</b> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arabic_language" title="Arabic language" about="#mwt5" typeof="mw:Transclusion" class="mw-redirect" id="mwBw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"langx","href":"./Template:Langx"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ar"},"2":{"wt":"مؤسسة تسيير مصالح مطارات الجزائر بوهران"}},"i":0}}]}'>Arabic</a><span about="#mwt5">: </span><span lang="ar" dir="rtl" about="#mwt5">مؤسسة تسيير مصالح مطارات الجزائر بوهران</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Arabic-language_text" about="#mwt5" id="mwCA"/>, <span about="#mwt6" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwCQ" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"langx","href":"./Template:Langx"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"en"},"2":{"wt":"Airport Management Services Establishment of Algeria of Oran"}},"i":0}}]}'>English: </span><span lang="en" about="#mwt6">Airport Management Services Establishment of Algeria of Oran</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_explicitly_cited_English-language_text" about="#mwt6" id="mwCg"/> is an Algerian <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Concession_(contract)" title="Concession (contract)" id="mwCw">concessions</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Construction" title="Construction" id="mwDA">construction</a> company founded in 1987. Its head office is in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Es_Sénia" title="Es Sénia" id="mwDQ">Es Sénia</a>, in the southern suburbs of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oran" title="Oran" id="mwDg">Oran</a>.</p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwDw" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwEA" aria-labelledby="History"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="History">History</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=EGSA_Oran&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: History"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwEQ">EGSA Oran was created by decree N° 87-174 of 11 August 1987. It was transformed in its legal nature into a public establishment of an industrial and commercial nature by executive decree N° 91-150 of 18 May 1991. the establishment is endowed with the mission of public services and under the supervision of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ministry_of_Public_Works_and_Transport_(Algeria)" title="Ministry of Public Works and Transport (Algeria)" id="mwEg">Ministry of Public Works and Transport</a>.<sup about="#mwt9" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-EGSAO_1-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"EGSAO"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-EGSAO-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-EGSAO-1" id="mwEw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFQ">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFg">]</span></span></a></sup> In 2013 the company undertook the construction of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ahmed_Ben_Bella_Airport" title="Ahmed Ben Bella Airport" id="mwFw">Ahmed Ben Bella Airport</a> expansion works.<sup about="#mwt12" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-2" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-2" id="mwGA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwGQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGg">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwGw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="2" id="mwHA" aria-labelledby="Airports"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Airports">Airports</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=EGSA_Oran&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Airports"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwHQ">EGSA Oran operates the following airports:<sup about="#mwt13" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-EGSAO_1-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"EGSAO"}}'><a href="#cite_note-EGSAO-1" id="mwHg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwHw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIA">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>
<ol id="mwIg"><li id="mwIw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oran" title="Oran" id="mwJA">Oran</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ahmed_Ben_Bella_Airport" title="Ahmed Ben Bella Airport" id="mwJQ">Ahmed Ben Bella Airport</a></li>
<li id="mwJg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tlemcen" title="Tlemcen" id="mwJw">Tlemcen</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zenata_-_Messali_El_Hadj_Airport" title="Zenata - Messali El Hadj Airport" class="mw-redirect" id="mwKA">Zenata - Messali El Hadj Airport</a></li>
<li id="mwKQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tiaret" title="Tiaret" id="mwKg">Tiaret</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abdelhafid_Boussouf_Bou_Chekif_Airport" title="Abdelhafid Boussouf Bou Chekif Airport" id="mwKw">Abdelhafid Boussouf Bou Chekif Airport</a></li>
<li id="mwLA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mécheria" title="Mécheria" id="mwLQ">Mécheria</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheikh_Bouamama_Airport" title="Cheikh Bouamama Airport" id="mwLg">Cheikh Bouamama Airport</a></li>
<li id="mwLw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Béchar" title="Béchar" id="mwMA">Béchar</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boudghene_Ben_Ali_Lotfi_Airport" title="Boudghene Ben Ali Lotfi Airport" id="mwMQ">Boudghene Ben Ali Lotfi Airport</a></li>
<li id="mwMg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mascara,_Algeria" title="Mascara, Algeria" id="mwMw">Mascara</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ghriss_Airport" title="Ghriss Airport" id="mwNA">Ghriss Airport</a></li>
<li id="mwNQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adrar,_Algeria" title="Adrar, Algeria" id="mwNg">Adrar</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Touat-Cheikh_Sidi_Mohamed_Belkebir_Airport" title="Touat-Cheikh Sidi Mohamed Belkebir Airport" id="mwNw">Touat-Cheikh Sidi Mohamed Belkebir Airport</a></li>
<li id="mwOA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tindouf" title="Tindouf" id="mwOQ">Tindouf</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Commandant_Ferradj_Airport" title="Commandant Ferradj Airport" id="mwOg">Commandant Ferradj Airport</a></li>
<li id="mwOw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Bayadh" title="El Bayadh" id="mwPA">El Bayadh</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/El_Bayadh_Airport" title="El Bayadh Airport" id="mwPQ">Kssal Airport</a></li>
<li id="mwPg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Timimoun" title="Timimoun" id="mwPw">Timimoun</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Timimoun_Airport" title="Timimoun Airport" id="mwQA">Gourara Timimoun Airport</a></li>
<li id="mwQQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bordj_Badji_Mokhtar" title="Bordj Badji Mokhtar" id="mwQg">Bordj Badji Mokhtar</a> – <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bordj_Badji_Mokhtar_Airport" title="Bordj Badji Mokhtar Airport" class="mw-redirect" id="mwQw">Bordj Badji Mokhtar Airport</a></li></ol>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwRA" aria-labelledby="See_also"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="See_also">See also</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=EGSA_Oran&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: See also"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
